sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant I as codegen (code-generation tool + its PRISM plugin)
    participant P as PRISM (bridge, UI thread, job)
    participant C as CodeCommit
    Note over I,P: Both sides optional. PRISM publishes ~/.prism/codegen-bridge.json when enabled.
    I->>C: create pull request (aws codecommit create-pull-request)
    I->>P: POST /v1/reviews (request_id, PR, callback, context, iteration=1)
    P-->>I: 202 review_id
    P->>P: UI thread admits → ordinary job (review → describe → merge pipeline)
    P->>C: review, write findings to PR description
    alt Request changes / Block
        P->>I: POST callback (decision=changes-requested, feedback)
        I->>I: findings → agent prompt; agent fixes, pushes to same branch
        I->>P: POST /v1/reviews (iteration=2, new request_id)
        Note over P: 409 no-new-commits if nothing was pushed;<br/>409 iteration-limit after max rounds
    else Approve
        P->>C: fast-forward merge (all gates apply; high impact asks a human)
        P->>I: POST callback (decision=merged)
    end
    Note over I,P: Callback lost? codegen polls GET /v1/reviews/{id}
